(   Determiners introduce noun phrases and determine their referential specificity:) Tj
T*
(   - Articles: Definite \(the\) and Indefinite \(a, an\).) Tj
T*
(   - Demonstratives: this, that, these, those.) Tj
T*
(   - Quantifiers: all, every, each, several, few, many, much.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Resolving Ambiguity with Demonstrative Adjectives:) Tj
T*
(   A ubiquitous flaw in scientific papers is the 'unattended demonstrative pronoun'???using 'This') Tj
T*
(   or 'That' as a solitary subject:) Tj
T*
(   - Vague: "The enzyme precipitated at pH 4.0. This led to denaturation.") Tj
T*
(   - Specific \(Demonstrative Adjective + Summary Noun\): "The enzyme precipitated at pH 4.0. This) Tj
T*
(   precipitation led to irreversible denaturation.") Tj
T*
(   - By supplying the summary noun, the writer reinforces cognitive continuity and prevents) Tj
T*
(   referential ambiguity.) Tj
T*
() Tj
